---
title: "withdrawRaisedCapital (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: caller check
    q_check_auth --> q_check_precond: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_precond --> q_calc_fees: hasEnded AND refundPeriodExpired AND capitalPublished
    q_check_precond --> q_revert_precond: preconditions not met
    q_revert_precond --> [*]: revert PreconditionsNotMet
    q_calc_fees --> q_transfer_legion: legionFee = raisedCapital * legionFeeOnCapitalRaisedBps / 10000
    q_transfer_legion --> q_transfer_referrer: transfer legionFee to legionAddress
    q_transfer_referrer --> q_transfer_project: transfer referrerFee to referrerAddress
    q_transfer_project --> [*]: transfer remaining to projectAdmin, emit CapitalWithdrawn

    note right of q_calc_fees
        INV-001: fee distribution = legion + referrer + project = totalRaisedCapital
        INV-002: early withdrawal before token supply is permitted
        INV-003: post-withdrawal vesting modifications prohibited
    end note
